  "description": "Monthly chibi short dramas written by Tooru Toba featuring the characters of <i>Tensai Ouji no Akaji Kokka Saisei Jutsu</i> in the lead up to the January 2022 premiere of the TV anime. Posted on the NBCUniversal Anime/Music YouTube Channel and later on the Blu-ray release of the series.<br><br>\n\n<b>Includes:</b><br>\n• Fest (フェス), released on Aug 11, 2021<br>\n• Bunka no Hata ni wa Shoko no Kage (文化の傍には食の影), released on Sep 21, 2021<br>\n• Halloween no Cosplay (ハロウィンのコスプレ), released on Oct 30, 2021<br>\n• Kinroukansha no Hi (勤労感謝の日), released on Nov 23, 2021<br>\n• Santa Claus o Tsukamaete (サンタクロースを捕まえて), released on Dec 23, 2021",
